{"seq":2,"slug":"the-systematizer-of-knowledge","title":"The Systematizer Of Knowledge","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/the-systematizer-of-knowledge","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-encyclopedic-mind","title":"百科全书式的心智","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/the-systematizer-of-knowledge/the-encyclopedic-mind","wordCount":1784,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-classification-of-sciences","title":"科学的分类","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/the-systematizer-of-knowledge/the-classification-of-sciences","wordCount":1820,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现亚里士多德作为知识之体系化者的贡献。他拥有一颗百科全书式的心智，研究涵盖了当时几乎所有的知识领域，并在众多领域作出了奠基性贡献，是古代世界知识的集大成者。他还依据知识的目的与对象，将科学系统地分为理论、实践、制作三类，使各门知识各得其位。本章揭示亚里士多德体系化的治学精神。\n"}